    "sentence_translations": [
      "Red Eggs",
      "",
      "In China, if a family has a newborn baby, we will give friends and relatives red eggs as a gift.",
      "",
      "Red eggs are chicken eggs that have been dyed red.",
      "Red eggs can also be called ”xǐ dàn”, “xǐ” means happy.",
      "Because a newborn baby in a family is a happy event, we want to let everyone know.",
      "",
      "If it is a boy, we will give six or eight red eggs. If it is a girl, we’ll give five or seven red eggs.",
      "We can know from the number of red chicken eggs if the baby born in the family giving red eggs is a boy or a girl.",
      ""
